      478.39,
      298.21,
      545.73
    ],
    "text": "I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below is required for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
