    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      562.39,
      298.21,
      657.73
    ],
    "text": "All that allotment of land depicted in the Advance Tracing No. Maha/PSK/2023/129 dated 31.05.2023, prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village of Dekinda in the Grama Niladhari Division of Mapakanda (Division No. 1101) in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Pasbage Korale in the District of Kandy, Central Province and bounded as follows:",
